Privacy Policy 
Last Updated: April 2026
VitalScan AI is committed to your privacy. Because our app processes sensitive biometric information, we adhere to a "Privacy by Design" philosophy.
Data Collection: VitalScan AI uses your smartphone camera to analyze facial and body markers for wellness tracking.
On-Device Processing: All image analysis and biometric calculations are performed 100% on your device.
Storage: We do not upload, store, or share your raw video or photo data to any external cloud servers.
Third-Party Sharing: Your health data is never sold to third parties or advertisers.
User Control: You have full control over your health reports and can delete all local data at any time within the app settings.

