Specialist Tip for the Play Store "Data Safety" Section:
When you fill out the Data Safety form in the Google Play Console:
Select "Yes" for "Does your app collect or share any of the required user data types?"
Ensure you check the box that says "Data is processed ephemerally" (since the video is processed in real-time and not stored).
Highlight that "Data is encrypted in transit" if you allow users to email their reports.
